Name: libinput
URL: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libinput/libinput
Version: 1.32.0
Revision: 5cf833b572f5a33663888da321dce0ba1abd82a2
Update Mechanism: Autoroll
License: MIT
License File: src/COPYING
Shipped: no
Security Critical: no

Description:
Input device management and event handling library.

This is only used in tests.

Local Modifications:
None.

This is updated by an autoroller that tracks upstream release tags.
libinput-version.h is generated at build time from the upstream template, and
include/config.h doesn't depend on the libinput version, so a roll normally
only needs to update DEPS. If a roll fails:
1. Add any new sources from the upstream meson.build to BUILD.gn.
2. If upstream changed its configuration checks, run on_update.sh and check in
   the regenerated include/config.h.
